{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1521849600, "end_date": 1522540799, "month_true_total": 212, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:50:47 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "41184006", "author": {"steamid": "76561198243289372", "personaname": "Rien que pour vos yeux", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198243289372/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3789, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1035, "last_played": 1706528136, "avatar": "d763532b0d1ec78b16ecffd1dce4e807e6bcec16"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "cnnn，跟着撤离路线走，走着走着你给我TM遁地，真当我是矿工吗？让我一路挖到撤离点？", "timestamp_created": 1522515275, "timestamp_updated": 1522515275, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.550000011920928955", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41176086", "author": {"steamid": "76561198252644388", "personaname": "godboy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198252644388/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 7628, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 493, "last_played": 1717510013, "avatar": "1c0b5c37a442a2d39f32902ec42f2e26ba6a142e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好玩就是人少 希望大家都来买 真的很爽 特别是最后拿下 特刺激", "timestamp_created": 1522493439, "timestamp_updated": 1522493439, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41142241", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005617873", "personaname": "ONE PUNCH MAN", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/18603139801/", "num_games_owned": 108, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 507, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 346, "last_played": 1569723486, "avatar": "6247ab60cd33963bb4245c640d43a8daf38874f2"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这游戏 非常好玩期待后续优化！！！！", "timestamp_created": 1522373676, "timestamp_updated": 1522373676, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41066552", "author": {"steamid": "76561198140568217", "personaname": "Vengeance is near...", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TDzds/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 63221, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1762, "last_played": 1697203130, "avatar": "74a4af309be17aa7c1138287a3d0c5301d10cddd"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这游戏多人体验还不错，然而游戏内容还是太少。在高难度下，单人体验极差，只会一味的没完没了的刷怪，久了就很厌烦，而且很讨厌，怪群就是强压过来，一波接一波的刷一模一样的虫潮，来压迫你。也许在多人联机下这样的体验勉强还可以，然而却没好好的考虑单人和多人模式的平衡，而且确实单人很无聊，就是没完没了的杀虫，射虫，炸虫，除了刷一堆虫子，这游戏就没啥其他内容了，考虑再三，我还是要给个差评。。。(也许以后加了新内容会变好吧，大概。。)\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nFor Ukraine!!!", "timestamp_created": 1522081684, "timestamp_updated": 1646400284, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41062220", "author": {"steamid": "76561198263700598", "personaname": "Blooder", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198263700598/", "num_games_owned": 208, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 17350, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3023, "last_played": 1690471493, "avatar": "d7b7988e7bc32f8e08ab167acd110bf8783e59af"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "算是很棒的四人联机合作战斗挖矿游戏了，难度等级基本可以认为是战斗时间和挖矿时间之比，所以刚进游戏游玩的新人玩家最好把所有地图都打难度一过一遍，熟悉地图特点和初期主练角色之后再加入/开高等级房间体验。\n\n枪手可以说是最简单的入手角色了，单体稳定输出+秒怪的C4以及手枪和基本可以风筝怪物的活动钩索好处不要太多，重甲；\n其次是钻机，群体近程范围喷火器+C4+上天入地无所不能的钛合金钻机，基本可以做的全图无死角挖掘，鸡肋可能就是手枪威力比较小，杀怪不是特别给力，重甲；\n工程一个人就是一支军队，霰弹榴弹肩上扛，单撸炮台托比昂，火力有保证，其次身上的平台枪可以和侦察兵协作挖掘陡峭岩壁上的矿藏，算是很强的火力支援+辅助，轻甲；\n侦查兵狙击+近程威力MAX的霰弹手炮+随时可以掏出来范围麻痹减速敌人的电磁爆弹能够预先解决自爆虫和牵制大规模虫潮的能力，照明箭能够提供中长时间的稳定照明，钩锁枪可以在射程范围内快速移动，方便快捷，集团先锋/总指挥，轻甲。\n\n游戏里的怪物主要分为星球的原生怪物和不定时刷出/由虫巢孵化的虫子，威胁比较大的就是洞穴水蛭，无畏刁虫和自爆刁虫了；洞穴水蛭，洞顶附着，会捕捉范围内的矮人然后缩回洞顶的怪物，尤其要注意的是很有可能刷在着陆点旁边，因此队伍里最好有一个侦察兵射箭探路，可以防止绝大多数情况下葫芦娃救爷爷式的团灭（血的教训）。刁虫的弱点是口器附近和尾部，但是无畏刁虫的嘴部是无敌的（划重点），因此打法是一个人在前面引，另外三人绕后输出；自爆刁虫颜色鲜亮在靠近矮人之后会发出嘶嘎的声音并且会将附近的矮人吸引过去然后自爆，因此优先打掉并且时机抓得好的话能炸死不少其他的虫子。\n其次最近更新的沼泽污泥尽量避开，因为会长时间减速，地图上的电石能用武器打掉，大家以后不要耿直的再直接走过去了（笑）。\n希望制作方能够开发更多新类型的敌人，地图和任务，那样这款游戏的可玩性和寿命会极大的上升。\n\n8.5/10        希望大家能够玩的开心", "timestamp_created": 1522066329, "timestamp_updated": 1522066329, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.633213937282562256", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}